OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright start across
OL,6,FShetland, but outbreaks of rain over
OL,7,FOrkney extending north into Shetland
OL,8,Fthis morning. Drier and brighter
OL,9,Fspells then developing in Orkney
OL,10,Fduring the afternoon. Mainly moderate
OL,11,Fsouth or southeast winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSoon turning drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter across Shetland, although the
OL,15,Fodd shower still possible. Mainly dry
OL,16,Fwith some clear spells developing
OL,17,Fovernight. Fresh southwest winds at
OL,18,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
