OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FIt will be bright with the
OL,6,Fbest of the sunshine across Orkney. A
OL,7,Fscattering of showers and winds
OL,8,Fturning into the west, these strong at
OL,9,Ftimes in Shetland.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FBright with occasional sunny or clear
OL,13,Fspells. Showers, these most widespread
OL,14,Fand heavy on Friday and Saturday.
OL,15,FMainly moderate southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
